    "author": "Rustedbeee",
    "description": " \nA project of a mod that will include three planets but so far only two is playable.\n\nThis mod has to be played on 147+\n\nRusted dunes is a type of mod that's not hard or easy and your goals are to make technology in use of eroded materials or rusted materials and produce rusted units and soon upgrade them to there potential.\n\nDunes is a wasted planet near serpulo but far from the sun, take control and provide chaos to this dead planet.\n\nQuick notes: [\nLushion is currently in WIP.\nBe sure to have weather graphics for weather's if your on a low end device turn it off.\nMake sure to reinstall regular.\nGive a star if you enjoy Thanks!!!.\nThe sound is being worked on so don't worry to much\nmany sectors are kinda unbalanced so be warned iam balancing it \n}\n",
